        "zh-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "4a7d2666-2a71-3f2c-963c-17b951aa3704",
                "word": "Ivan",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "113a24c8-f358-377d-abce-33a7ef68347c",
                        "entry_id": "4a7d2666-2a71-3f2c-963c-17b951aa3704",
                        "glosses": [
                            "伊凡；英語圈男性人名，源自俄語"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "93d461db-42a5-4f30-a3f1-c352a3af2782",
                                "sense_id": "113a24c8-f358-377d-abce-33a7ef68347c",
                                "text": "Amy's husband was called Ivan. Ivan the Terrible, Barry always called him, naturally. 'Ivan? What kind of name is that?' he said to Tracy after Amy's engagement was announced. 'Bloody Russian.'\n'Actually, I think it's because he had a Norwegian grandfather', Tracy said.\n'Norwegian?' Barry said incredulously, as if she'd just announced that Ivan's family came from the moon.",
                                "translation": "艾米的丈夫名叫伊凡。當然了，巴里總是叫他「恐怖伊凡」。「伊凡？這算什麼名字啊？」艾咪宣布訂婚後，巴里對翠絲說道：「該死的俄國佬。」\n「其實，我覺得是因為他有個挪威籍的祖父。」翠絲說。\n「挪威人？」巴里一臉難以置信地說，那表情彷彿翠絲剛宣布伊凡的家人是從月球來的一樣。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "276d8b5f-020f-3580-a344-fae0f522060a",
                        "entry_id": "4a7d2666-2a71-3f2c-963c-17b951aa3704",
                        "glosses": [
                            "伊凡；俄語男性名字Ива́н (Iván) 的轉寫。"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "430bbe52-1863-334d-815a-7a5c4f6891f2",
                        "entry_id": "4a7d2666-2a71-3f2c-963c-17b951aa3704",
                        "glosses": [
                            "伊凡；馬其頓語男性名字Иван (Ivan) 的轉寫。"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
